   "source": [
    "# Plant Disease Detection — Training on Colab (GPU)\n",
    "\n",
    "Run all cells in order. End-to-end time: ~15-30 min on a free Colab GPU.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before you start:**\n",
    "1. Open `https://colab.research.google.com/` and create a new notebook.\n",
    "2. Upload your `archive.zip` (the PlantVillage dataset, ~2 GB) to the root of your Google Drive.\n",
    "3. Runtime → Change runtime type → **GPU (T4)**.\n",
    "4. Paste this notebook's contents into the Colab cells, or upload this file directly via *File → Upload notebook*."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Check GPU"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import tensorflow as tf\n",
    "print('TF:', tf.__version__)\n",
    "print('GPU available:', tf.config.list_physical_devices('GPU'))\n",
    "\n",
    "assert tf.config.list_physical_devices('GPU'), 'No GPU found. Set Runtime → GPU.'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Mount Drive and prepare the project"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Adjust this to wherever archive.zip lives in your Drive.\n",
    "DRIVE_PROJECT_DIR = '/content/drive/MyDrive/crop disease'\n",
    "ARCHIVE_NAME = 'archive.zip'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os, shutil, pathlib\n",
    "\n",
    "# Use a fast local path on the Colab VM, not Drive (Drive is slow for the\n",
    # thousands of small image files during training).\n",
    "LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR = '/content/crop-disease'\n",
    "if os.path.exists(LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR):\n",
    "    shutil.rmtree(LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR)\n",
    "shutil.copytree(DRIVE_PROJECT_DIR, LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR)\n",
    "print('Copied project to', LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR)\n",
    "print(os.listdir(LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Install dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%cd $LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR\n",
    "!pip install -q -r requirements.txt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Run training\n",
    "\n",
    "This does everything end-to-end: extract → split → train phase 1 → fine-tune phase 2 → save best_model.h5 + curves."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!python main.py train"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Run evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "Produces `outputs/classification_report.txt` and `outputs/confusion_matrix.png`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!python main.py evaluate"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Run Grad-CAM"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!python main.py explain"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Copy outputs back to Drive\n",
    "\n",
    "After this cell runs, `outputs/` will be in your Drive and ready to use locally."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "src = pathlib.Path(LOCAL_PROJECT_DIR) / 'outputs'\n",
    "dst = pathlib.Path(DRIVE_PROJECT_DIR) / 'outputs'\n",
    "if dst.exists():\n",
    "    shutil.rmtree(dst)\n",
    "shutil.copytree(src, dst)\n",
    "print('Copied outputs back to:', dst)\n",
    "print(os.listdir(dst))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Predict on a single image (optional)\n",
    "\n",
    "Upload a leaf image to the project folder, then run:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
